ith Monica so she can use her health insurance. Meanwhile, Ursula continues to come between Phoebe and Joey.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/79168/303837.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":17,\"absoluteNumber\":17,\"seasonNumber\":1,\"lastUpdated\":\"2024-10-07 19:46:32\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1995\"},{\"id\":303838,\"seriesId\":79168,\"name\":\"The One with All the Poker\",\"aired\":\"1995-03-02\",\"runtime\":22,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Rachel interviews for a job as an assistant buyer. She also sees another side of the usually docile Ross when the girls face the boys during a not-so-friendly game of poker.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/79168/303838.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":18,\"absoluteNumber\":18,\"seasonNumber\":1,\"lastUpdated\":\"2024-10-07 19:47:05\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1995\"},{\"id\":303839,\"seriesId\":79168,\"name\":\"The One Where the Monkey Gets Away\",\"aired\":\"1995-03-09\",\"runtime\":22,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"The gang searches frantically for Marcel, who slipped out of the apartment while Rachel was baby-sitting him.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/79168/303839.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":19,\"absoluteNumber\":19,\"seasonNumber\":1,\"lastUpdated\":\"2024-10-07 19:47:51\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1995\"},{\"id\":303840,\"seriesId\":79168,\"name\":\"The One with the Evil Orthodontist\",\"aired\":\"1995-04-06\",\"runtime\":22,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Rachel and Barry start dating again, despite the fact that he's now engaged to Mindy; Chandler goes nuts when a woman he likes won't return his phone calls.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/79168/303840.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":20,\"absoluteNumber\":20,\"seasonNumber\