's feelings for Rachel. Joey takes part in a fertility study and is unable to sleep with his new girlfriend.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/79168/303844.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":24,\"absoluteNumber\":24,\"seasonNumber\":1,\"lastUpdated\":\"2024-10-07 19:51:53\",\"finaleType\":\"season\",\"year\":\"1995\"},{\"id\":303845,\"seriesId\":79168,\"name\":\"The One with Ross's New Girlfriend\",\"aired\":\"1995-09-21\",\"runtime\":22,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Rachel waits patiently at the airport for Ross, not knowing he is returning with a new girlfriend. Meanwhile, Phoebe is persuaded to cut Monica's hair and Chandler has an unpleasant experience with Joey's tailor.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/79168/303845.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":1,\"absoluteNumber\":25,\"seasonNumber\":2,\"lastUpdated\":\"2024-10-07 19:56:07\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1995\"},{\"id\":303846,\"seriesId\":79168,\"name\":\"The One with the Breast Milk\",\"aired\":\"1995-09-28\",\"runtime\":22,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Ross is grossed out by Carol's breast milk and Rachel is uncomfortable with Monica's growing friendship with Julie. Meanwhile, Joey competes with a fellow cologne spritzer..\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/79168/303846.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":2,\"absoluteNumber\":26,\"seasonNumber\":2,\"lastUpdated\":\"2024-10-07 19:56:49\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1995\"},{\"id\":303847,\"seriesId\":79168,\"name\":\"The One Where Heckles Dies\",\"aired\":\"1995-10-05\",\"runtime\":22,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"After Mr. Heckles dies, Chandler discovers eerie similarities between the man and his own life. Ross and Phoebe argue over the progression of evolution.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/79168/303847.jpg\",\"