nics when she learns that Ross has planned their whole life together.\\r\\n\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/79168/303864.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":20,\"absoluteNumber\":44,\"seasonNumber\":2,\"lastUpdated\":\"2024-10-07 20:09:09\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1996\"},{\"id\":303865,\"seriesId\":79168,\"name\":\"The One with the Bullies\",\"aired\":\"1996-04-25\",\"runtime\":22,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Chandler and Ross run into two bullies at Central Perk. Monica tries her luck at the stock market to avoid taking a job at a 1950s themed diner. Phoebe drives upstate for a second time to meet her father while Joey and Rachel accompany her.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/79168/303865.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":21,\"absoluteNumber\":45,\"seasonNumber\":2,\"lastUpdated\":\"2024-10-07 20:09:38\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1996\"},{\"id\":303866,\"seriesId\":79168,\"name\":\"The One with the Two Parties\",\"aired\":\"1996-05-02\",\"runtime\":22,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"The gang plans a surprise party for Rachel, but the real surprise is when both of her estranged parents show up for the same party.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/79168/303866.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":22,\"absoluteNumber\":46,\"seasonNumber\":2,\"lastUpdated\":\"2024-10-07 20:10:07\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"1996\"},{\"id\":303867,\"seriesId\":79168,\"name\":\"The One with the Chicken Pox\",\"aired\":\"1996-05-09\",\"runtime\":22,\"nameTranslations\":null,\"overview\":\"Phoebe catches chicken pox just as an old flame arrives in town on leave from the Navy. Joey gets a job at Chandler's office. Monica is upset that Richard doesn't have any quirks.\",\"overviewTranslations\":null,\"image\":\"/banners/episodes/79168/303867.jpg\",\"imageType\":12,\"isMovie\":0,\"s